inase and type  X collagen in the same section. Obviously the immunofluorescence for the  type X collagen is visualizing the protein and not the mRNA. However,  we feel that this comparison is valid, since our previous studies on type X  collagen show concomitant appearance of the mRNA and protein.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>